# API_PKC Implementations

Rules:
- Each instance directory must build independently with `make clean` and `make`.
- Each instance must contain official interface files: `KAT_KEX.c`, `KEX_AlgorithmInstance.c/.h`, `drng.c/.h`, `auxfunc.c/.h`.
- Official files (`KAT_KEX.c`, `drng.*`, `auxfunc.*`) should not be modified in content.
- Randomness must be bridged through official DRNG context.
- Hash/XOF/KDF adaptation should converge to official auxfunc path in follow-up steps.
- `Reference_Implementation` sources originate from repository root `ref/`.
- `Optimized_Implementation` sources originate from repository root `avx2/`, but each submission instance is self-contained.
